Need to update your billing address for invoices or purchases? On Beat22, you can easily **delete and add a new one**. Here’s how: **Step-by-Step: Update Your Billing Address**

1.  **Log in to Your Account** Go to [beat22.com](https://beat22.com) and sign in with your buyer account.
2.  **Click on Your Profile Icon (Top Right Corner)** Once logged in, click your profile icon at the top-right of the page.
    
    ![Click on Your Profile Icon (Top Right Corner) Once logged in, click your profile icon at the top-right of the](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-184159.png)
    
3.  **Go to “Settings”** From the dropdown menu, select **“Settings”** to open your account settings.
    
    ![Go to “Settings” From the dropdown menu, select “Settings” to open your account settings.](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-184217.png)
    
4.  ********Find the “Billing Address” Section Scroll to the Billing Address area.********
    
    ![Find the “Billing Address” Section Scroll to the Billing Address area.](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-191644.png)
    
5.  **Click the Trash Icon 🗑️ To remove your existing address, click the dustbin icon next to it.**
6.  **Add a New Billing Address You can keep the previous billing address and add a new billing address as well. Click “Add Address” and enter your new billing details.**
7.  **Save Changes Once entered, click Save to update.**

## **Why This Matters:**

-   **Keeps your invoices accurate**
-   **Ensures smooth payment processing**
-   **Helps with tax and legal compliance**

 **If you face any trouble updating your billing details, email us at support@beat22.com — we’ll help you out quickly!**
